  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "沉重喉叫"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>陳俐雯</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">踏　紅phàⁿ-phàⁿ ê地毯</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">扛　重khoâiⁿ-khoâiⁿ ê責任</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Hō͘擔頭硩kah khiau-ku ê笑容</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Phēⁿ-phēⁿ喘弓一款生存ê角度</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">年久月深ê沉重</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">歲月消磨笑容</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">心聲、誓言　激做一chūn酸</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Sut過目墘</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">查埔人</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">用堅強妝thāⁿ ê面容</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">藏　心悶脆弱</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">大喙開開ê疼</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">喉叫：</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">入世ê肩胛到底ài偌硬插？</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span></span><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjLLmRawXpFetkMpUEa28dAv22oqVswFFvObcZsXykGkVbtdKxSEnY5ruWd_ERsue5TBRbFzRVifa-FLEvOOPQiKiOfRzdKhRSw2TctzXR21CfYrcsuUs-6Nt9rLjJT6Cj4Pm7jDSJLUIT1a4FAfzHvnOiKbUvhgaFxjL4EBQbpPpbmMnXD11SXLIiFaqbM/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1359%E6%9C%9F_044_b.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjLLmRawXpFetkMpUEa28dAv22oqVswFFvObcZsXykGkVbtdKxSEnY5ruWd_ERsue5TBRbFzRVifa-FLEvOOPQiKiOfRzdKhRSw2TctzXR21CfYrcsuUs-6Nt9rLjJT6Cj4Pm7jDSJLUIT1a4FAfzHvnOiKbUvhgaFxjL4EBQbpPpbmMnXD11SXLIiFaqbM/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1359%E6%9C%9F_044_b.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjfPndxndbzL1Xz5oJSWAHQB-L2QLhk50yFgKaAuwlRl4sE-TqUZqiJSGYJdA0duH89Y8pGGaYtGnWTPdjDh5_I6drSOgW8l_yfu_vip0eU5BM8sEv01_3Wpd2DhAEwmakeTtsaBtEvDdEiE1SeQLN6fG3-36qvGwAqyOa9-BtiKz48ONHG9pGlA5m1rj4W/s1423/359%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1423\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEjfPndxndbzL1Xz5oJSWAHQB-L2QLhk50yFgKaAuwlRl4sE-TqUZqiJSGYJdA0duH89Y8pGGaYtGnWTPdjDh5_I6drSOgW8l_yfu_vip0eU5BM8sEv01_3Wpd2DhAEwmakeTtsaBtEvDdEiE1SeQLN6fG3-36qvGwAqyOa9-BtiKz48ONHG9pGlA5m1rj4W/w450-h640/359%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"